"\n"
"<p>The preview shows what the currently \n"
"selected paragraph borders will look like.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>To <i>add</i> a new border: Select the desired style,\n"
"width and color.  Click the toggle button that corresponds\n"
"to that border.</p>\n"
